{"logId": "35135957-b49d-4af3-b925-d1c6e5110480", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "text", "block_content": "对外说。", "block_bbox": [241, 229, 313, 253], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[241.0, 229.0], [312.0, 229.0], [312.0, 252.0], [241.0, 252.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "于东来常说：“经商，就是在经营人品。”", "block_bbox": [280, 263, 641, 288], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[280.0, 263.0], [641.0, 263.0], [641.0, 288.0], [280.0, 288.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "目前胖东来5000多名正式员工中下岗职工占了60%。企业员工流动性极小，平均工资4.5年。胖东来刚开始创业时就只有于东来和4名下岗职工，在公司扩张过程中，他也优先录用下岗工人。他发誓把自己的事业做大做强，为更多下岗工提供就业机会。于东来有一个美好的愿景：做一个中国乃至世界上最漂亮的店，标准就是：环境家庭式的，员工之间亲人一样，顾客购物像回家。", "block_bbox": [238, 299, 1015, 359], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 299.0], [1015.0, 299.0], [1015.0, 359.0], [238.0, 359.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [239, 367, 603, 567], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 367.0], [603.0, 367.0], [603.0, 567.0], [239.0, 567.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [621, 390, 992, 631], "block_id": 4, "block_order": null, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[621.0, 390.0], [992.0, 390.0], [992.0, 631.0], [621.0, 631.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [74, 602, 223, 726], "block_id": 5, "block_order": null, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[74.0, 602.0], [223.0, 602.0], [223.0, 726.0], [74.0, 726.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "细雨蒙蒙中前往许昌采访许昌胖东来商贸公司董事长于东来。此前一直听说他绝对是我们河南优秀雇主的代表。出现在", "block_bbox": [240, 578, 612, 674], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[240.0, 578.0], [612.0, 578.0], [612.0, 674.0], [240.0, 674.0]]}, {"block_label": "vision_footnote", "block_content": "拓展训练", "block_bbox": [918, 642, 992, 661], "block_id": 7, "block_order": null, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[918.0, 642.0], [991.0, 642.0], [991.0, 660.0], [918.0, 660.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "我们面前的于东来很随意地穿着件休闲的红毛衣，像个邻家大哥，和员工走在一起分不出哪个人是老总。他给人的第一印象淳朴真诚，极其低调。交流当中，他总是谦逊地说自己文化不高，水平有限，但几个小时听下来，你就会被他的率真、真诚所打动，被他的经营理念和个人魅力所折服。他是8000多名员工的大家长，整个企业像个快乐的大家庭，在他", "block_bbox": [238, 683, 1016, 813], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 683.0], [1016.0, 683.0], [1016.0, 813.0], [238.0, 813.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [244, 826, 547, 1030], "block_id": 9, "block_order": null, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[244.0, 826.0], [547.0, 826.0], [547.0, 1030.0], [244.0, 1030.0]]}, {"block_label": "vision_footnote", "block_content": "幸运的保洁员大姐", "block_bbox": [244, 1034, 388, 1054], "block_id": 10, "block_order": null, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[244.0, 1034.0], [387.0, 1034.0], [387.0, 1053.0], [244.0, 1053.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "的企业里，所有的员工见到他，都亲切地称呼他为“东来哥”。说起做企业，他用了两个词：尊重和快乐。尊重顾客的人格，带一个快乐的团队。他教育员工，要时时替别人着想，让别人感到快乐。已届不惑之年，于东来笑起来却依然天真得如孩童一般，见过的人无不被他快乐的笑容所感染。他又像个调皮的大孩子，喜欢玩，喜欢打牌，喜欢玩游戏，喜欢旅游。", "block_bbox": [557, 822, 1015, 1057], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[557.0, 822.0], [1015.0, 822.0], [1015.0, 1057.0], [557.0, 1057.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "还喜欢谈论漂亮女人。这就是率真的、快乐的于东来。", "block_bbox": [240, 1066, 697, 1090], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[240.0, 1066.0], [697.0, 1066.0], [697.0, 1090.0], [240.0, 1090.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "[经典语录]", "block_bbox": [280, 1136, 387, 1161], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[280.0, 1136.0], [387.0, 1136.0], [387.0, 1161.0], [280.0, 1161.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1 我们的企业也许不是最大的，但我们一定要尽全力把它做成最好的，最快乐的。——关于快乐", "block_bbox": [258, 1170, 1003, 1229], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[258.0, 1170.0], [1003.0, 1170.0], [1003.0, 1229.0], [258.0, 1229.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7386674284934998, "coordinate": [241, 229, 313, 253], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[241.0, 229.0], [312.0, 229.0], [312.0, 252.0], [241.0, 252.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8038942813873291, "coordinate": [280, 263, 641, 288], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[280.0, 263.0], [641.0, 263.0], [641.0, 288.0], [280.0, 288.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8967438340187073, "coordinate": [238, 299, 1015, 359], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[238.0, 299.0], [1015.0, 299.0], [1015.0, 359.0], [238.0, 359.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9486440420150757, "coordinate": [239, 367, 603, 567], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[239.0, 367.0], [603.0, 367.0], [603.0, 567.0], [239.0, 567.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9606323838233948, "coordinate": [621, 390, 992, 631], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[621.0, 390.0], [992.0, 390.0], [992.0, 631.0], [621.0, 631.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.7003190517425537, "coordinate": [74, 602, 223, 726], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[74.0, 602.0], [223.0, 602.0], [223.0, 726.0], [74.0, 726.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9331820011138916, "coordinate": [240, 578, 612, 674], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[240.0, 578.0], [612.0, 578.0], [612.0, 674.0], [240.0, 674.0]]}, {"cls_id": 24, "label": "vision_footnote", "score": 0.7340991497039795, "coordinate": [918, 642, 992, 661], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[918.0, 642.0], [991.0, 642.0], [991.0, 660.0], [918.0, 660.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9489914178848267, "coordinate": [238, 683, 1016, 813], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[238.0, 683.0], [1016.0, 683.0], [1016.0, 813.0], [238.0, 813.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9552859663963318, "coordinate": [244, 826, 547, 1030], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[244.0, 826.0], [547.0, 826.0], [547.0, 1030.0], [244.0, 1030.0]]}, {"cls_id": 24, "label": "vision_footnote", "score": 0.6823093891143799, "coordinate": [244, 1034, 388, 1054], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[244.0, 1034.0], [387.0, 1034.0], [387.0, 1053.0], [244.0, 1053.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.953046977519989, "coordinate": [557, 822, 1015, 1057], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[557.0, 822.0], [1015.0, 822.0], [1015.0, 1057.0], [557.0, 1057.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8085035085678101, "coordinate": [240, 1066, 697, 1090], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[240.0, 1066.0], [697.0, 1066.0], [697.0, 1090.0], [240.0, 1090.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7962232232093811, "coordinate": [280, 1136, 387, 1161], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[280.0, 1136.0], [387.0, 1136.0], [387.0, 1161.0], [280.0, 1161.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8553466796875, "coordinate": [258, 1170, 1003, 1229], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[258.0, 1170.0], [1003.0, 1170.0], [1003.0, 1229.0], [258.0, 1229.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "对外说。\n\n于东来常说：“经商，就是在经营人品。”\n\n目前胖东来5000多名正式员工中下岗职工占了60%。企业员工流动性极小，平均工资4.5年。胖东来刚开始创业时就只有于东来和4名下岗职工，在公司扩张过程中，他也优先录用下岗工人。他发誓把自己的事业做大做强，为更多下岗工提供就业机会。于东来有一个美好的愿景：做一个中国乃至世界上最漂亮的店，标准就是：环境家庭式的，员工之间亲人一样，顾客购物像回家。\n\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_621_390_992_631.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"31%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_74_602_223_726.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"12%\" /></div>\n\n\n细雨蒙蒙中前往许昌采访许昌胖东来商贸公司董事长于东来。此前一直听说他绝对是我们河南优秀雇主的代表。出现在\n\n拓展训练\n\n我们面前的于东来很随意地穿着件休闲的红毛衣，像个邻家大哥，和员工走在一起分不出哪个人是老总。他给人的第一印象淳朴真诚，极其低调。交流当中，他总是谦逊地说自己文化不高，水平有限，但几个小时听下来，你就会被他的率真、真诚所打动，被他的经营理念和个人魅力所折服。他是8000多名员工的大家长，整个企业像个快乐的大家庭，在他\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_244_826_547_1030.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"25%\" /></div>\n\n\n幸运的保洁员大姐\n\n的企业里，所有的员工见到他，都亲切地称呼他为“东来哥”。说起做企业，他用了两个词：尊重和快乐。尊重顾客的人格，带一个快乐的团队。他教育员工，要时时替别人着想，让别人感到快乐。已届不惑之年，于东来笑起来却依然天真得如孩童一般，见过的人无不被他快乐的笑容所感染。他又像个调皮的大孩子，喜欢玩，喜欢打牌，喜欢玩游戏，喜欢旅游。\n\n还喜欢谈论漂亮女人。这就是率真的、快乐的于东来。\n\n## [经典语录]\n\n1 我们的企业也许不是最大的，但我们一定要尽全力把它做成最好的，最快乐的。——关于快乐", "images": {"imgs/img_in_image_box_621_390_992_631.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//35135957-b49d-4af3-b925-d1c6e5110480/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_621_390_992_631.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A05%3A29Z%2F-1%2F%2Fc555764f80eb412b18a7111a75d89831a37a89e50df591f0cb835f1dd0101529", "imgs/img_in_image_box_74_602_223_726.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//35135957-b49d-4af3-b925-d1c6e5110480/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_74_602_223_726.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A05%3A29Z%2F-1%2F%2Ff77aa6ddf34deb7f6e7b7acf87f1608b0dec46b1175ae9d5d18bf170695c6f21", "imgs/img_in_image_box_244_826_547_1030.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//35135957-b49d-4af3-b925-d1c6e5110480/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_244_826_547_1030.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A05%3A29Z%2F-1%2F%2F39387ff155b19923937024907ef4a065f9b5726b3d3b6d265addd404a17a2059"}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//35135957-b49d-4af3-b925-d1c6e5110480/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A05%3A29Z%2F-1%2F%2Fc1a67c86071024278dd5e6d631292285c79142b3ddda544e77f016067b21832a"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//35135957-b49d-4af3-b925-d1c6e5110480/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A05%3A29Z%2F-1%2F%2Fcd7eb197d97724f7d88f67364c24289b4adbb3e772fa70783a7ea95c9e38f388"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1190, "height": 1684}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//35135957-b49d-4af3-b925-d1c6e5110480/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A05%3A29Z%2F-1%2F%2F44f5743207523486d75c03df5479512116adb7148ed27f1763a264a287a93d45"]}, "errorCode": 0, "errorMsg": "Success"}
